Third-party assets
==================

src/assets/symbols/*.svg  (and the copies inlined into dist/bel-meteogram.js)

  Yr weather symbols
  Copyright (c) 2015 Yr/NRK
  Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence
  (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

  Source: https://github.com/nrkno/yr-weather-symbols

  Changes made by Belgingur: re-exported to flatten the <symbol>/<use>
  structure into standalone SVG documents, raster shading textures replaced
  with SVG gradients, and files renamed to the legacy numeric symbol codes
  ("01d" ... "50") emitted by our forecast pipeline.

  These files are used under CC BY 4.0 and are not relicensed under the MIT
  licence above. Redistribution must retain this attribution, including the
  /*! */ banner in dist/bel-meteogram.js.

  Nothing here implies that Belgingur, or bel-meteogram, is affiliated with
  or endorsed by Yr, NRK or MET Norway.
